WHAT THIS COVERS
----------------

This license covers the Ferrum macOS/Apple Silicon port — the original work in
this repository authored by PyroSoft, including but not limited to:

  * Source/DarwinDriver/          the macOS driver, its Vulkan/Metal bridge,
                                  the NT syscall and Win32 surfaces, and its
                                  fixtures and gates
  * BOURBON_PORT.md               the engineering record
  * docs/assets/                  the Ferrum marks

It does NOT cover the upstream FEX-Emu code this repository is forked from, nor
any third-party component. Those keep their own licenses — see THIRD-PARTY below.

