HOW TO OBTAIN A LICENSE
-----------------------

Two routes:

1. AS PART OF BOURBON. End users receive a license to use Ferrum as an
   integrated component of Bourbon, under Bourbon's own end-user terms. Using
   Bourbon requires no separate Ferrum license.

       https://mikethetech.itch.io/bourbon26

2. COMMERCIAL LICENSING. Separate licensing — for use outside Bourbon, for
   redistribution, for embedding in another product, or for source access — is
   available. Terms are negotiated per engagement.

       contact@mikethetech.com

